  "about": {
    "headline": "Built by AI practitioners. Made for the real world.",
    "body": "Syrix was founded by the team behind Xperc — a consulting firm that has deployed AI solutions for enterprises across Vietnam, from fintech to real estate to manufacturing. We saw the same pattern everywhere: companies invested in AI but couldn't make it execute real work.\n\nSo we built Syrix — not as another AI tool, but as an execution platform that bridges the gap between AI that talks and AI that does.\n\nOur team combines deep expertise in AI/ML, enterprise integration, and business process optimization."
  },
